Scope note / 适用范围说明

This MIT license covers the application layer written for this project:
app/, tests/, docs/, backtest/engine_cross_section.py, and the new scripts
added on top of the upstream codebase.

The CSMD dataset (CSMD50 / CSMD300) and the upstream LightQuant framework code
are third-party works. Their use is governed by their original licenses and
terms; if you use the dataset, cite the original CSMD / CIKM 2025 paper.

本 MIT 许可覆盖本项目的应用层代码（app/、tests/、docs/、
backtest/engine_cross_section.py 以及在上游代码基础上新增的脚本）。
CSMD 数据集与上游 LightQuant 框架代码属第三方作品，其使用遵循原始授权；
使用数据集请引用 CSMD / CIKM 2025 原论文。
